&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Bring With You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency managing core enterprise SaaS products such as Okta, Google Workspace, Slack, Zoom, Jira, Confluence, and Microsoft 365.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating tasks and integrating systems using platforms like Workato, Okta Workflows, or Microsoft Power Automate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI platforms like Anthropic Claude and Google Gemini, including prompt engineering and connecting systems through emerging standards like the Model Context Protocol (MCP).&lt;/li&gt;
