&lt;li&gt;macOS and Windows operating system administration skills, including experience with MDMs like Jamf and Intune.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with conference room AV and shared-space technology, like Zoom Rooms and Neat devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Cisco Meraki and basic networking concepts like VLANs, DNS, DHCP, and wireless networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, especially on large cross-functional projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity to balance a mix of urgent, interrupt-driven tasks and project-level work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent customer service and communication skills, written and verbal, with a habit of treating colleagues like customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at translating technical concepts and communicating to non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding problem solving abilities, with a desire to get to the root of sophisticated issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-versed in IT operations best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience with IT, 2+ of which were in an engineering or sysadmin capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A college degree or credible panache.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
